{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"And So, Our Mistaken Youth Begins.\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-05\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After writing a less than flattering essay about his high school life, Hachiman is forced to join a very unique club with only one member.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4516061.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"こうして彼らのまちがった青春が始まる.\"},{\"title\":\"All People Surely Have Their Own Worries.\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-12\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As Hachiman continues his narrative of his school life, tension rises in the room as Yui attempts to break away from her social group. If that wasn't enough, the club has received a new request from a unique visitor.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530919.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"きっと, 誰しも等し並みに悩みを抱えている.\"},{\"title\":\"Sometimes the Gods of Rom-Coms Does Nice Things.\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-19\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Hachiman continues his solitary lifestyle by using his skills to ensure he is left alone during gym and lunch. His routine is broken by the appearance of Saika Tosuka, who has come to him with a request.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530920.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"たまにラブコメの神様はいいことをする.\"},{\"title\":\"In Other Words, He Doesn`t Have Many Friends.\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-26\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Hachiman questions what it is like having a sister in real life means. While walking her to school she brings up the car accident he was in while saving a dog. At school, he is once again berated by Shizuka on his response to the \\\"Career Observation Application survey\\\". When he finally makes it to the club room, a mysterious text sets off the clubs next request.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530921.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"つまり, 彼は友達が少ない.\"},{\"title\":\"Once Again, He Turns Back on the Path from Whence He Came.\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-03\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Hachiman's younger sister, Hikigaya Komachi, was asked to give advice to a fellow classmate, Kawasaki Taishi. Apparently his sister had been acting strange. His older sister, Kawasaki Saki (though Hachiman wasn't aware of this), was in the same class as Hachiman and Yui, so the Service Club decided to help with the issue.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530922.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"またしても, 彼は元来た道へ引き返す.\"},{\"title\":\"His Beginning with Her Finally Ends.\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-10\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Shizuka announces that Hachiman and Yui must go on a recruitment drive to find more members, and they know exactly who to target.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530923.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ようやく彼と彼女の始まりが終わる.\"},{\"title\":\"Anyway, Getting No Rest, Even Though It`s Summer Break, Just Isn`t Right.\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-17\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Shizuka is constantly calling and texting Hachiman while he tries to relax during summer vacation.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530924.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ともあれ, 夏休みなのに休めないのは何かおかしい.\"},{\"title\":\"One Day, They Will Learn the Truth.\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-24\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Shizuka readies a bonfire and a “test of courage.” Later, Yui recognizes the limo that hit Hachiman.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530925.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"いずれ彼ら彼女らは真実を知る.\"},{\"title\":\"For the Third Time, He Turns Back on the Path from Whence He Came.\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-31\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Hachiman becomes restless as summer draws to an end. A Firework Festival opens the door for more teasing and many SNAFUs!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530926.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"三度, 彼は元来た道へ引き返す.\"},{\"title\":\"The Distance Between Them Remains Unchanged, As the Festival Is Becoming a Carnival.\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Yui notices a rift forming between Hachiman and Yukino. Hachiman is nominated to serve on the committee for the school's upcoming cultural festival.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530927.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"依然として彼らの距離は変わらずに, 祭りはもうすぐカーニバる.\"},{\"title\":\"And So the Curtain on Each Stage Rises, and the Festival Is Festivaling Its Very Best.\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Hachiman and Yui check on Yukino. Later, Hachiman shakes things up with the committee when he decides to alter their mindset.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530928.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"そして, それぞれの舞台の幕が上がり, 祭りは最高にフェスティバっている.\"},{\"title\":\"Thus, His and Her and Her Youth Continues to Be Wrong.\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Soubu High's Cultural Festival continues and Hachiman is stuck carrying out his duty as a committee member by documenting the day's events on film.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4530929.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"それでも彼と彼女と彼女の青春はまちがい続ける.\"},{\"title\":\"Thus, Their Festival Will Never End.\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2013-06-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"A mysterious request to helm the upcoming sports festival arrives. The group must band together to figure out a way to pull it off.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/267435/4587074.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"だから, 彼らの祭りは終わらない.\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}